text This specification does not require support of any particular network protocol, style sheet language, scripting language, or any of the DOM specifications beyond those required in the list above. However, the language described by this specification is biased towards CSS as the styling language, JavaScript as the scripting language, and HTTP as the network protocol, and several features assume that those languages and protocols are in use. @17,101890,694,102
text A user agent that implements the HTTP protocol must implement (Cookies) as well. @17,102004,694,20
